---
import PageNeighbours from '../components/PageNeighbours.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config';
import '../styles/portfolio-rooms.css';
import '../styles/town-residents.css';
---
<Layout title="关于我" description="了解明鑫的学习背景、工作方式、游戏经历与联系方式。">
  <div class="pf-container pf-room pf-resident-room">
    <header class="pf-room-header"><div><p class="pf-room-kicker">镇上的人 <span>/ 明鑫</span></p><h1>你好，我是明鑫。</h1></div></header>
    <div class="pf-resident-intro">
      <div class="pf-resident-desk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pf-resident-desk__window"></span><span class="pf-resident-desk__shelf"></span><span class="pf-resident-desk__papers"></span><img class="pf-resident-desk__tools" src="/images/scenes/workbench-tools.svg" alt="" width="224" height="112" /><span class="pf-resident-desk__table"></span></div>
      <section class="pf-resident-letter" aria-label="自我介绍"><span class="pf-resident-letter__stamp" aria-hidden="true">M</span><p>我在集美大学学习戏剧影视文学，想做游戏系统策划。关注规则、人物与故事，怎样一起塑造体验。</p><p>把想法写成流程，把流程做进原型，再回到游戏里检验。《童话冒险》就是这样长成的。</p><a href="/projects/fairytale-demo/">看看这场冒险 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="pf-resident-letter__signature" aria-hidden="true">明鑫</span></section>
    </div>
    <section class="pf-resident-notes" aria-label="背景与实践">
      <div><p class="pf-room-kicker">01 / 学习</p><h2>集美大学</h2><p>戏剧影视文学 · 本科</p><p class="pf-resident-notes__date">2022.09—2027.06</p></div>
      <div><p class="pf-room-kicker">02 / 做游戏</p><h2>规则，也要能玩。</h2><p>系统策划、关卡流程与数值配置。<br />用 Godot 原型、Excel 和流程图检验想法。</p><a href="/projects/">项目展厅 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div><p class="pf-room-kicker">03 / 写故事</p><h2>给行动一个理由。</h2><p>剧本、对白与世界观。<br />从冲突、节奏与人物动机出发。</p><a href="/projects/huanzhenming/">唤她真名 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <div class="pf-resident-invitation"><img src="/images/scenes/envelope.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" /><div><h2>有空，来信。</h2><a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a></div><a class="pf-resident-resume" href={siteConfig.resumeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">带走一份简历 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <PageNeighbours section="about" />
  </div>
</Layout>